{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-confinement-category","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:confinement-category","kind":"definition","title":"The confinement category $\\mathbf{Conf}$","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-confined-particle","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-level-sufficiency"],"tags":["category","confinement","morphism","folding","unfolding","dressing"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementCategory","text":"confinement-category.md","leanSource":"confinement-category.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:confinement-category\"></a><p><em>The <strong>confinement category</strong> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbf{Conf}</code> has:</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><em><strong>Objects:</strong> confined particles <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">P</code> at every level <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\ell \\ge 0</code>.</em></li>\n<li><em><strong>Morphisms:</strong> structure-preserving maps organised into three families:</em></li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><em>Family</em></th>\n<th><em>Symbol</em></th>\n<th><em>Action</em></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><em>Unfolding</em></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\uparrow_\\ell</code></td>\n<td><em>Replace each level-<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\ell</code> strand by its level-<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(\\ell-1)</code> constituent braid</em></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><em>Folding</em></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\downarrow_\\ell</code></td>\n<td><em>Quotient a subbraid at level <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\ell-1</code> to a single level-<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\ell</code> strand</em></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><em>Dressing</em></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{dress}</code></td>\n<td><em>Extend <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">H_n(R, q) \\hookrightarrow H_{n+m}(q)</code> and attach <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">m</code> additional strands via an SDP-feasible binding subword</em></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<ul>\n<li><em><strong>Composition:</strong> concatenation of Hecke-algebra embeddings. One right-composes <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{dress}</code> with <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\uparrow_\\ell</code> and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\downarrow_\\ell</code>.</em></li>\n<li><em><strong>Identity:</strong> the identity embedding <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{id}_P: H_{n_0}(q) \\hookrightarrow H_{n_0}(q)</code>.</em></li>\n</ul>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-category.md","heading":"Definition","number":"9.9.3","page":"b/def-confinement-category","qa":{"counts":{"pass":78,"fail":1,"warn":2,"na":11,"unknown":0,"stale":78},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.ConfinementCategory","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-category.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
